STRINGTABLE 
BEGIN
    IDS_INFO                "MESH DEBUG:\r\n\r\nA small utility for developers. Meshdebug can be used to visually identify a mesh group in a vessel mesh. Set the camera focus on the vessel whose meshes you want to inspect. Then open the mesh debugger dialog from the Custom functions list (Ctrl-F4). The vessel meshes will become semi-transparent, and the selected mesh group will blink."
    IDS_TYPE                "Developer resources and samples"
END

